  Get by label -> whenever you are identifying any label ensure it has label tag and the input should be wrapped inside
  the label tag.
  <Label> Password <input type = "Password" /> </Label>
  Or the id of input should be associated with the for of the label's input box
  if id of input and for attribute of label are same, get_label() method will work
   Eg:     <label for="username"> Username: </label>
           <input id="username" />
  if id of input and for attribute of label are not same, get_label() method will not work
    Eg :  <label for="email"> Email: </label>
           <input id="userEmail" />

